  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in perceived regional escalation drives risk‑off reallocations by global investors, who withdraw capital from higher‑risk eurozone assets (especially periphery credits) into safe‑haven assets, raising net capital outflow rates.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
