  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">A rising perception of broad regional escalation motivates major powers and intermediaries to open and intensify informal, off‑record channels to deconflict simultaneous crises and avoid miscalculation.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">mid_east_gulf_escalation</data>
