  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in backchannel diplomacy that reduces near‑term escalation risk causes investors to trim the geopolitical risk premium on eurozone sovereign debt, narrowing sovereign spreads within weeks.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war_diplo</data>
