  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased informal/trilateral Russian diplomatic contacts with Gulf and Iranian actors opens negotiation pathways and confidence‑building arrangements that translate into coordinated mediation and de‑escalation efforts.</data>
