  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Intense domestic protests and civil disorder in eurozone states force redeployment or reduced participation of naval and security assets used for Gulf convoy and port protection, lowering deterrence and enabling more frequent/severe non‑state attacks on shipping and terminals.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
