  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in domestic protests triggers emergency orders and political pressure on platform operators and telecoms to restrict content, throttle services or hand over access, increasing the degree of private communications control available to states and platforms relevant to wartime diplomatic and information operations.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
