  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A rapid rise in eurozone sovereign yields forces European banks and asset managers to crystallize losses and de-risk by selling foreign equity positions, producing a material short‑term withdrawal of European capital from AI-related funds and IPOs.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">eurozone_bond_stress</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
