  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A widening eurozone sovereign spread increases market and policymaker perceptions of Western political/economic fragility, which regional actors interpret as reduced deterrence and thus lifts assessments of the probability and potential scale of Middle East/Gulf escalation.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
