  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Widening eurozone sovereign spreads compel EU governments to retrench politically and financially from external security and partnership initiatives, prompting neighbouring states to accelerate pivots toward Turkey or prompting Turkey to deepen ties with non‑EU actors, thereby speeding regional realignment.</data>
