  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Heightened fiscal financing pressure forces budget and staffing cuts in foreign ministries and intelligence services, leading states to curtail resource‑intensive informal/trilateral backchannels used to manage tensions in the Russia–Ukraine conflict.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
