  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising fiscal financing pressure in eurozone states causes reductions or delays in NATO/EU deployments and cooperative defence programmes in the eastern Mediterranean/Black Sea, creating a security gap that Turkey fills by increasing defence diplomacy and bilateral security activity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">eurozone_bond_stress</data>
  <data key="d39">turkey_regional_realignm</data>
